---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Instant Web Engineering & B2B Performance Analytics" 
	lang="en" 
	description="High-performance serverless web development designed to boost conversions and eliminate hosting fees."
>
	<!-- Hero Section Google Style -->
	<header class="space-y-6 my-16 max-w-2xl">
		<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-tight">
			Instant web infrastructure.<br/>
			<span class="text-blue-600">Zero recurring hosting costs.</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 font-normal leading-relaxed">
			We build purified web architectures engineered without bulky databases or obsolete infrastructure. Maximum conversion speed, completely zeroed maintenance fees.
		</p>
	</header>

	<!-- Section: Web Engineering Numbers -->
	<section class="my-16 space-y-6">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Why speed is a financial metric</h2>
		<div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3 text-center">
			<div class="p-6 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-gray-50/50">
				<p class="text-4xl font-bold text-blue-600">&lt; 1s</p>
				<p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 mt-2">Loading Time</p>
				<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Well below the critical drop-off threshold for mobile users.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-gray-50/50">
				<p class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">100/100</p>
				<p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 mt-2">Google Core Vitals Score</p>
				<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Maximum SEO search engine penalization completely avoided.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-6 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl bg-gray-50/50">
				<p class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-600">$0</p>
				<p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 mt-2">Annual Hosting Expense</p>
				<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Leveraging global serverless edge networks with free tier allocation.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Technical & Financial Analysis Table (Light Version) -->
	<section class="my-16 space-y-4">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Technical & Financial Analysis</h2>
		<div class="overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
			<table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-sm">
				<thead>
					<tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200 text-gray-600">
						<th class="p-4 font-medium">Business Core Feature</th>
						<th class="p-4 font-medium text-red-600 bg-red-50/30">Legacy Systems (WordPress)</th>
						<th class="p-4 font-medium text-blue-600 bg-blue-50/30">Our Cloud Architecture</th>
					</tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200 text-gray-700">
					<tr>
						<td class="p-4 font-medium text-gray-900">Mobile Load Speed</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-gray-500 bg-red-50/10">High latency (3-6 seconds of waiting)</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-gray-900 font-medium bg-blue-50/10">Instantaneous (Under 1 second)</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="p-4 font-medium text-gray-900">Annual Server Costs</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-gray-500 bg-red-50/10">$150 to $400 / every year</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold bg-blue-50/10">Included for life ($0/year)</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="p-4 font-medium text-gray-900">Security & Maintenance</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-gray-500 bg-red-50/10">Constant software patches needed</td>
						<td class="p-4 text-gray-900 bg-blue-50/10">Zero exposed databases, immune to exploits</td>
					</tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Section: Our Workflow Method -->
	<section class="my-16 space-y-6">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Our 3-Phase Pipeline</h2>
		<div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
			<div class="space-y-2">
				<div class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Phase 1</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Extraction & Diagnosis</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We crawl and audit your current digital footprint to accurately measure revenue loss caused by structural performance bottlenecks.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-2">
				<div class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Phase 2</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Pure Compilation</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We compile clean source code, stripping away heavy plugins and redundant logic, rebuilding the structure natively.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-2">
				<div class="text-xs font-bold font-mono text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Phase 3</div>
				<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900">Serverless Deployment</h3>
				<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">We distribute your web presence across next-gen geographically redundant edge networks, binding your existing corporate domain.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Section: Frequently Asked Questions -->
	<section class="my-16 space-y-6 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm max-w-2xl">
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How is it possible that hosting costs are zero?</h4>
				<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Traditional websites require an active database server running 24/7 to process page requests. Our architecture pre-compiles your files before publication: the site becomes a ready-to-serve package that advanced global content delivery networks distribute for free without computational overhead.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Can I keep my current custom domain (e.g., .com / .net)?</h4>
				<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Absolutely. Your domain remains completely in your ownership. We will configure your DNS routing records to point securely to the accelerated infrastructure without any downtime for your current clients.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">How long does the restructuring take?</h4>
				<p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Once we gather your brand assets, copies, and imagery, our optimized pipeline allows us to deliver the finalized, fully audited code ready for global rollout in about 7-10 business days.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Contact Module (Clean Google Form style) -->
	<section class="my-16 p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50/30 space-y-6 shadow-sm">
		<div class="space-y-2">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Request a Free Performance Audit</h2>
			<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 max-w-xl">
				Provide your current business link. We will generate a complete data report highlighting structural bottlenecks along with a custom optimization blueprint.
			</p>
		</div>
        <form name="contact-portfolio-en" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/en/" class="space-y-4 text-sm">			<div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
				<div class="space-y-1">
					<label for="name-en" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Name or Company</label>
					<input type="text" id="name-en" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 text-gray-900 transition-shadow shadow-sm" placeholder="e.g., Nexus Corp" />
				</div>
				<div class="space-y-1">
					<label for="email-en" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Corporate Email</label>
					<input type="email" id="email-en" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 text-gray-900 transition-shadow shadow-sm" placeholder="name@company.com" />
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<label for="website-en" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Current Website (To Analyze)</label>
				<input type="url" id="website-en" name="website" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 text-gray-900 transition-shadow shadow-sm" placeholder="https://www.yourcompany.com" />
			</div>
			<div class="space-y-1">
				<label for="message-en" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Operational Notes</label>
				<textarea id="message-en" name="message" rows="3" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 text-gray-900 transition-shadow shadow-sm" placeholder="Let us know about any specific digital goals or technical issues..."></textarea>
			</div>
			<div class="pt-2">
				<button type="submit" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 active:bg-blue-800 transition-colors rounded-lg shadow-sm">
					Submit Audit Request
				</button>
			</div>
		</form>
	</section>
</Layout>
